    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>USER STORY :</b>  As an user , I want to return a product from completed sales invoices. After Successfully return product is added back to inventory , all related sales , report , stock valuation , transactions are updated correctly.</p>

<p><b>Acceptance Criteria</b> :</p>

<p><b>1. Full Product Return</b></p>

<ul>
	<li><b>Given</b> a sales invoice contains a sold product,</li>
	<li><b>When</b> the user returns the entire sold quantity,</li>
	<li><b>Then</b> the complete quantity should be added back to stock.</li>
</ul>


<ol>
	<li><b>Partial Product Return After Sales Invoice :</b><br/>
<b>Given</b> Selected Multiple Products and completed sales invoice.<br/>
<b>When</b> the user returns only a portion of the sold quantity<br/>
<b>Then</b>  only the return quantity should  be added to the stock.</li>
	<li><b>Stock Update :</b><br/>
<b>Given</b> a user sold the product.<br/>
<b>When</b> an user product return a portion of the sold quantity. <br/>
<b>Then</b> product return should be added back to the stock.</li>
	<li><b>Return Quantity Validation :</b><br/>
<b>Given</b> an user creates a completed sales invoice<br/>
<b>When</b> the user enters a return quantity greater than the available returnable quantity,<br/>
<b>Then</b> the system should reject the return and display an appropriate validation message.</li>
	<li><b>Stock Valuation Update:</b><br/>
<b>Given</b> the user creates a completed sales invoice<br/>
<b>When</b> the product returned.<br/>
<b>Then</b> The system should updated the stock valuation </li>
	<li><b>Sales Amount Update :</b><br/>
<b>Given</b>  The user sold product .<br/>
<b>When</b> The product returned.<br/>
<b>Then</b>  The sales amount should be updated and correctly.</li>
</ol>


<h4><a name="7.ProfitUpdate%3A"></a>7.  Profit Update :</h4>

<p>       <b>Given</b> a sales invoice has generated profit,<br/>
      <b>When</b> a product is returned,<br/>
      <b>Then</b> the system should recalculate the profit correctly based on the returned quantity.</p>

<h4><a name="8.ReportsUpdate%3A"></a>8. Reports Update :</h4>

<p>    <b>Given</b> a product return has been completed,<br/>
   <b>When</b> the user views inventory, sales, stock valuation, or profit reports,<br/>
   <b>Then</b> the reports should reflect the returned product and updated values correctly.</p>






            <br/>
